        <headline>Lake Wind Advisory issued September 26 at 1:07AM MDT until September 26 at 9:00AM MDT by NWS Glasgow MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 40 mph.

* WHERE...Fort Peck Lake

* WHEN...Until 9 AM MDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds and rough waves on area lakes will create
hazardous conditions for small craft.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Waves up to 4 feet are possible through the
morning.
</description>
        <instruction>Boaters on Fort Peck Lake should use extra caution since strong winds
and rough waves can overturn small craft.</instruction>
